        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: The Ricks Must Be Crazy; Rick and Morty (season 2)\n- People: Dan Guterman; Dominic Polcino\n- Organizations: Adult Swim; Cartoon Network\n- Topics: air dates; television episodes; season premieres and finales\n\nFacts:\n- Rick and Morty season 2 premiered in the United States on July 26, 2015 with the episode \"A Rickle in Time\".\n- The second season of Rick and Morty originally aired in the United States on Cartoon Network's late-night programming block Adult Swim.\n- The episode \"The Ricks Must Be Crazy\" was written by Dan Guterman and directed by Dominic Polcino.\n- \"The Ricks Must Be Crazy\" first aired on Adult Swim in the United States on August 30, 2015.\n- Rick and Morty season 2 concluded on October 4, 2015 with the episode \"The Wedding Squanchers\".",
